{"id":"03ce75d03367ed92","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-ci-reaping-number.md","title":"ZFC CI Reaping Number","display":"df-zfc-ci-reaping-number — ZFC CI Reaping Number","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ci-reaping-number","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ci-reaping-number"],"display":"df-zfc-ci-reaping-number — ZFC CI Reaping Number","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-comb8-reaping-family.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ci-reaping-number"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ci-reaping-number</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ci-reaping-number — ZFC CI Reaping Number"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fc164b16c8b58308\" href=\"?note=fc164b16c8b58308\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-comb8-reaping-family.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-comb8-reaping-family.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak r\\in\\mathrm{Card}\">\\(\\mathfrak r\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\)</span> (cardinal)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb8ReapingFamily}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb8ReapingFamily}_S\\)</span> (reaping-family predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fc164b16c8b58308\" href=\"?note=fc164b16c8b58308\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-comb8-reaping-family.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-comb8-reaping-family.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ReapingNumber}\">\\(\\operatorname{ReapingNumber}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\kappa\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Card}\">\\(\\mathrm{Card}\\)</span> 为类缩写，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对非空序数集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min C\">\\(\\min C\\)</span> 为满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in C\\land\\forall\\xi\\in C\\;(m\\subseteq\\xi)\">\\(m\\in C\\land\\forall\\xi\\in C\\;(m\\subseteq\\xi)\\)</span> 的唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>；此记号仅在其非空域使用。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}reaping\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\operatorname{ReapingNumber}(\\mathfrak r)\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak r\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\land \\mathfrak r=\\min\\{|\\mathcal R|:\\mathrm{ZfcComb8ReapingFamily}_S(\\mathcal R)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}reaping\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\operatorname{ReapingNumber}(\\mathfrak r)\\leftrightarrow\\mathfrak r\\in\\mathrm{Card}\\land \\mathfrak r=\\min\\{|\\mathcal R|:\\mathrm{ZfcComb8ReapingFamily}_S(\\mathcal R)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The reaping-family predicate is reused so the almost-containment direction is not duplicated.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-comb8-reaping-family.md","status":"resolved","id":"fc164b16c8b58308","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-comb8-reaping-family.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-comb8-reaping-family.md","status":"resolved","id":"fc164b16c8b58308","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcComb8ReapingFa